cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SVR-DUN reproducibility code"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the paper and this repository.
  The paper's author list is a placeholder here because the manuscript this
  was built from is anonymised; fill it in before publishing.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SVR-DUN authors"      # TODO: replace with the real author list
repository-code: "https://github.com/OWNER/svr-dun-repro"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and verification tooling for Spatially-Varying-Rank
  Deep Unfolding (SVR-DUN) for budget-adaptive hyperspectral and multispectral
  image fusion. Includes provenance-tracked experiment configurations, dataset
  split specifications, an exact paired-statistics implementation, and
  consistency checks over the published tables.
keywords:
  - hyperspectral image fusion
  - multispectral image fusion
  - deep unfolding
  - low-rank representation
  - reproducibility
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Learning Where Rank Matters: Spatially-Varying-Rank Deep Unfolding for
      Budget-Adaptive Hyperspectral and Multispectral Image Fusion
    authors:
      - name: "SVR-DUN authors"  # TODO: replace with the real author list
    year: 2026
    notes: >-
      Fill in journal, volume, pages and DOI once available.
